@startuml

actor RemoteState

participant On
participant Pending_Shutdown
participant Off

On -> Pending_Shutdown : HeartBeat received with value \n greater than Power Down threshold \n (2^32 - 256)
Pending_Shutdown -> Off : HeartBeat NOT received within \n DTC timeout length AND \n device is not monitored \n (!IsRequested AND !IsRequester)

@enduml
